{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:59 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:59 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:59 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"「開心老闆」飛到馬到\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/ea135bc72bd404cf774a1a5b9253c957/2026-11/r8_6.jpg\"/><p>繼希威森之後，剛於昨日宣布與馬會提早解約的騎師霍宏聲，在今晚快活谷第八場策騎游達榮馬房的「開心老闆」一放到底，贏得其今季第九場頭馬，此駒入閘前獨贏賠率急跌至四點四倍，結果飛到馬到，順利勝出。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:23:57.719330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:59:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T01:11:44.135616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:17:21.140906+00:00","content_hash":"9318bc2ea27cbd6f5a6adbb2c7c8059a48d4af758d099e00e242cd36c8aacbc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}